    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="84.2a">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IICn">II Cn</ref> 84.2a</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">And wel ðære heorde ðe gefolgað ðam hyrde ðe hig deoflum ætwenað ⁊ Gode hig gestreonað.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">And well is it for the flock which follows the shepherd who delivers them from devils and wins them for God.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">And wel þære heorde, ðe gefolgað þam hyrde, þe hig deoflum ætweneð ⁊ Gode hig gestryneð.</ab>
      </div>
